<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1480 0 R/Alt(Flowchart. A main column runs from RTL Design through HDL, Logic Synthesis, Floorplanning, Placement, Clock Tree Synthesis, and Routing to Physical Verification and Tapeout. Logic Synthesis feeds Pre-Layout Simulation on the right, which points back to HDL. After Routing, a branch on the left runs up through Parasitic Extraction, Static Timing Analysis, and Post-Layout Simulation, which feeds back to Floorplanning, Placement, and, through Design Iteration, to the top of the flow.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[10]/Pg 29561 0 R>>
