<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 14958 0 R/Alt(Block diagram. In the top row, a generator box feeds a driver box with transactions, and the driver feeds the DUT box with pin values. Below the DUT is a monitor box. It receives the DUT outputs from above and the input pin values through a tap on the line between driver and DUT. The monitor feeds a coverage box on its right, a scoreboard box below it with the actual outputs, and a reference model box on the lower left with the inputs. The reference model feeds the scoreboard with the expected outputs, and the scoreboard produces pass or fail.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 29681 0 R>>
endobj
