20813 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 20814 0 R/Alt(Three prefix graphs side by side, each with eight columns labeled 7 to 0 from left to right and vertical lines from top to bottom. Ripple-carry: seven levels, on level k one dot in column k connected diagonally to column k minus 1, so the carry runs along a staircase from right to left. Brent-Kung: five levels. Level 1 has dots in columns 1, 3, 5, 7 combining with their right neighbors, level 2 dots in columns 3 and 7 from columns 1 and 5, level 3 a dot in column 7 from column 3, level 4 a dot in column 5 from column 3, and level 5 dots in columns 2, 4, 6 from columns 1, 3, 5. Kogge-Stone: three levels. Level 1 has dots in columns 1 to 7 from the column one to the right, level 2 dots in columns 2 to 7 from two to the right, and level 3 dots in columns 4 to 7 from four to the right.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[47]/Pg 29745 0 R>>
endobj
