<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 24827 0 R/Alt(Two block diagrams. Top: three registers data_q with 8 bits, shamt_q with 3 bits and mode_q with 2 bits receive data_i, shamt_i and mode_i and drive a green block barrel shifter, which drives the 8-bit register out_q, whose output is data_o. Bottom: an orange chain of four boxes, mode_q bits 1 to 0, shamt_q bits 2 to 0, out_q bits 7 to 0 and data_q bits 7 to 0, connected by arrows from the input scan_in_0 on the left to the output scan_out_0 on the right.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 29794 0 R>>
